all these bumps and rocks.

337
00:22:06.282 --> 00:22:07.948
Yeah, for over 30 minutes.

338
00:22:07.950 --> 00:22:09.483
Do the math, we passed it.

339
00:22:09.485 --> 00:22:12.852
He's right, we
need to turn around.

340
00:22:12.854 --> 00:22:14.088
