355
00:23:30.932 --> 00:23:33.202
(GROANING)

356
00:23:46.347 --> 00:23:48.784
(COUGHING)

357
00:24:03.032 --> 00:24:05.201
(GASPING)

358
00:24:08.571 --> 00:24:11.374
(UNEASY MUSIC)

359
