364
00:25:03.659 --> 00:25:05.057
Shit!

365
00:25:05.059 --> 00:25:06.025
Mommy.

366
00:25:06.027 --> 00:25:07.261
I'm sorry, baby.

367
00:25:07.263 --> 00:25:08.428
I tried turning
the engine over,

368
00:25:08.430 --> 00:25:11.198
