just before the crash.

369
00:25:11.200 --> 00:25:12.032
Mommy.

370
00:25:12.034 --> 00:25:13.266
Hold on.

371
00:25:13.268 --> 00:25:14.200
We're gonna be
out here for days

372
00:25:14.202 --> 00:25:16.203
