487
00:33:19.988 --> 00:33:21.019
Hold still.

488
00:33:21.021 --> 00:33:21.955
Oh, come on.

489
00:33:21.957 --> 00:33:22.755
I know, I know, I know.

490
00:33:22.757 --> 00:33:24.056
